        "created_at": "2019-12-18T07:50:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think they forgot one option for how OblivAeon effected Greatest Legacy- it lead to the history we know. Paul VIII did not raise Pauline (Felicia) the same way his father raised him. His Father (Grandpa Legacy) drilled into him the importanence of the family tradition and maintaining the Legacy line of heroics- \"You must me ready to be Legacy when I am gone\", \"Your child must be ready to become Legacy when you are gone\" - because Paul VII saw his son and granddaughter wearing Legacy costumes in the future fighting to save the world&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
